== throwing and catching ==
  baked with sugar
  no flour left
  the missing one was flour
== catching a parent ==
  something in the kitchen: the oven will not light
  something, anything: no eggs left
== which clause wins ==
  shopping: butter
  kitchen:  the oven will not light
  other:    something else entirely
== finally ==
  nothing wrong
  and the kitchen is tidied
  caught it
  and the kitchen is tidied again
== handing it on ==
  noted, but this is not mine to fix
  the caller dealt with it: no salt left
== the ones the language raises ==
  divided by zero
  reached past the end
  read an empty optional
  too big to hold
  a pattern that means nothing
== an answer, or the absence of one ==
  looking for sugar: sugar
  looking for salt:  not there
  cannot weigh -1 grams
